WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:17.283 --> 00:00:18.985
Welcome, everyone!

00:00:18.985 --> 00:00:22.489
Thank you for joining me online
to celebrate the accomplishments

00:00:22.489 --> 00:00:25.992
of the Yale graduates of 2021!

00:00:25.992 --> 00:00:29.029
Your deans and I congratulate
you for the extraordinary work

00:00:29.029 --> 00:00:32.165
you have completed in
your programs of study.

00:00:32.165 --> 00:00:34.467
We salute your effort,
your diligence,

00:00:34.467 --> 00:00:37.537
your talent, and your intellect.

00:00:37.537 --> 00:00:40.840
We also join you in expressing
gratitude for all who have

00:00:40.840 --> 00:00:42.909
supported you in
these endeavors:

00:00:42.909 --> 00:00:45.412
Your families and friends,
professors,

00:00:45.412 --> 00:00:48.581
and other members of
the Yale community.

00:00:48.581 --> 00:00:52.085
On June 4th, when you have been
recommended by the faculty

00:00:52.085 --> 00:00:55.722
of your school and approved by
the Corporation,

00:00:55.722 --> 00:00:58.691
your dean will ask me
by my official act

00:00:58.691 --> 00:01:02.295
to confer upon you your degree.

00:01:02.295 --> 00:01:03.930
By the authority vested in me,

00:01:03.930 --> 00:01:06.232
I shall confer upon you
your degree

00:01:06.232 --> 00:01:08.401
when designated by the dean

00:01:08.401 --> 00:01:14.040
and shall then admit you to all
its rights and responsibilities.

00:01:14.040 --> 00:01:19.546
Congratulations, to the
Yale graduates of 2021!

